From: kexec diagnostics <local>
Subject: [DIAG] arm64: accept bounded versioned KGSL NOMAP metadata

Parent: frozen ca789 target. Default-n diagnostic transport, exact ranges only.
No firmware/GPU call, backing read, earlier memblock resize, or owner claim.
Legacy ASCII limits remain32/256; binary v1 caps512 tuples and64MiB total.
All input/collision/capacity checks precede reserve/NOMAP; partial failure
continues to panic. Historical cache/replay does not query live ownership.

